EmitLoopExitModuleDoc
    Version: 1
    Language: en
    Format: STF
    Purpose: EmitLoopExit — loop exit emission (isLoop=true)

    Function
        Name: EmitLoopExit
        Params: state, b, term, bodyId, exitId, bid
        Returns: state

    DependsOn
        EmitInstrs, EmitCond, EmitBlock, Push, PushList

    Reads
        b["instrs"], term["cond"], state["labels"]

    Writes
        state["out"], state["labels"]

    Behavior
        Emits the structured loop block: BLOCK/LOOP, instrs, EmitCond, br_if 1, EmitBlock(bodyId), END/END, labels restore, EmitBlock(exitId)

    Notes
        Matches the isLoop=true path in emit_block
